<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose 10 points to 1,475.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose 10 points to 1,475.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,475 today from 1,465 on March 13, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
